# Population scale with frame zones (reports/engine/2026-11-26-npc-10k-logical/README.md, phase 0):
# 10k civilians live their routines while the hero stands alone; the frame profile breaks the cost
# down by zone, and the society export of the spawned world feeds the stand probe.
# The society-npc-* name gives this scenario a FRAME_PROFILE=ON build in scripts/ryzen.sh.
# @headless
# @timeout 2400
seed 73106
cheat god
world-check NEWWORLD.ZEN
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_VALLEY_091
npcscale stats start
npcscale 10000
wait 1500
npcscale stats end
society export world.json
